sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CI Pipeline
    participant CLI as lm-eval CLI
    participant TaskMgr as TaskManager
    participant Evaluator as Evaluator
    participant Backend as Model Backend<br/>(selected via --model)
    participant ExtAPI as External Model API<br/>(Anthropic/OpenAI/Watsonx)
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,S3: Phase 1: Initialization
    User->>CLI: lm-eval --model <backend><br/>--tasks <task_list><br/>--output_path <path>
    CLI->>CLI: Parse CLI arguments<br/>(cli_evaluate)
    CLI->>TaskMgr: Load task configurations
    TaskMgr->>HFHub: Download task datasets<br/>(if not cached)
    HFHub-->>TaskMgr: Dataset artifacts

    Note over User,S3: Phase 1a: Optional Asset Pre-fetch
    opt S3 asset pre-fetch enabled
        CLI->>S3: s3_downloader.py<br/>AWS IAM credentials
        S3-->>CLI: Evaluation assets
    end

    Note over User,S3: Phase 1b: Offline Metrics Mode
    opt HF_EVALUATE_OFFLINE=1
        CLI->>CLI: Load metrics from<br/>LMEVAL_METRICS_PREFIX<br/>(local path)
    end

    Note over User,S3: Phase 2: Model Instantiation
    CLI->>Backend: Instantiate model backend<br/>(--model argument selects backend)
    alt HuggingFace (hf)
        Backend->>HFHub: Download model weights<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (optional)
        HFHub-->>Backend: Model artifacts
    else Anthropic (anthropic-completions/chat)
        Backend->>Backend: Load ANTHROPIC_API_KEY<br/>from environment
    else OpenAI (openai-completions/chat)
        Backend->>Backend: Load OPENAI_API_KEY<br/>from environment
    else Watsonx (watsonx_llm)
        Backend->>Backend: Load WATSONX_API_KEY<br/>from environment
    end

    Note over User,S3: Phase 3: Evaluation Loop
    CLI->>Evaluator: simple_evaluate()
    loop For each task & sample
        Evaluator->>Backend: Generate prediction
        Backend->>ExtAPI: API request<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS<br/>Auth: API Key (Bearer)
        ExtAPI-->>Backend: Model response
        Backend-->>Evaluator: Prediction result
        Evaluator->>Evaluator: Score against ground truth
    end

    Note over User,S3: Phase 4: Results Output
    Evaluator-->>CLI: Evaluation metrics (JSON)
    CLI->>CLI: Write results to output_path

    opt Push to HuggingFace Hub
        CLI->>HFHub: Upload results<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN
    end

    opt Push to Weights & Biases
        CLI->>CLI: Log metrics to W&B
    end

    CLI-->>User: Evaluation complete<br/>JSON results
